## https://github.com/AlexsJones/llmfit?ref=terminaltrove#usage
Navigate models                                                       | j/k / Up/Dn
Enter search mode (partial match on name, provider, params, use case) | /
Exit search mode                                                      | Esc / Etr
Clear search                                                          | C-U
Cycle fit filter: All, Runnable, Perfect, Good, Marginal              | f
Cycle availability filter: All, GGUF Avail, Installed                 | a
Cycle sort column: Score, Params, Mem%, Ctx, Date, Use Case           | s
Enter Visual mode (select multiple models)                            | v
Enter Select mode (column-based filtering)                            | V
Cycle color theme (saved automatically)                               | t
Open Plan mode for selected model (hardware planning)                 | p
Open provider filter popup                                            | P
Open use-case filter popup                                            | U
Open capability filter popup                                          | C
Open license filter popup                                             | L
Open runtime/backend filter popup (llama.cpp, MLX, vLLM)              | R
Open hardware simulation popup (override RAM/VRAM/CPU)                | S
Open advanced configuration popup (tune efficiency, run mode factors) | A
Open community leaderboard view (localmaxxing.com)                    | b
Open inference bench view (local quality scoring against your models) | I
Open help popup (all key bindings)                                    | h
Mark selected model for compare                                       | m
Open compare view (marked vs selected)                                | c
Clear compare mark                                                    | x
Toggle installed-first sorting (any detected runtime provider)        | i
Download selected model (provider picker when multiple are available) | d
Open Download Manager (history, deletion, config)                     | D
Refresh installed models from runtime providers                       | r
Toggle detail view for selected model                                 | Etr
Scroll by 10                                                          | PgUp/PgDn
Jump to top/bottom                                                    | g/G
Quit                                                                  | q